<scroll-view class="polar-bear-page" scroll-y>
  <view class="polar-bear-shell">
    <view class="polar-bear-heading">
      <text class="polar-bear-title">胖胖北极熊</text>
      <text class="polar-bear-subtitle">布艺玩偶 · 纸样与制作参考</text>
    </view>

    <image
      class="polar-bear-cover"
      src="/assets/polar-bear-cover.jpeg"
      mode="widthFix"
      bindtap="previewImage"
      data-src="/assets/polar-bear-cover.jpeg"
      aria-label="胖胖北极熊布艺玩偶成品参考图"
    />

    <view class="polar-bear-intro">
      <text class="intro-title">裁片说明</text>
      <text class="intro-note">纸样内含头部、身体、腹部、耳朵、内腿、尾巴和鼻子等裁片。每张纸样顶部都有 10cm 标尺，打印或放大后请先核对比例。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="polar-bear-section">
      <text class="section-title">北极熊纸样</text>
      <text class="section-note">点按图片可放大查看标注和裁剪数量。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="pattern-list">
      <view wx:for="{{patterns}}" wx:key="src" class="pattern-item">
        <text class="pattern-label">{{index + 1}} · {{item.label}}</text>
        <image
          class="pattern-image"
          src="{{item.src}}"
          mode="widthFix"
          bindtap="previewImage"
          data-src="{{item.src}}"
          aria-label="{{item.label}}纸样"
        />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="polar-bear-section process-heading">
      <text class="section-title">制作提示</text>
      <text class="section-note">先完成头部和身体，再填充并组合；鼻子、眼睛和围巾可按成品风格搭配。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
